{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, shoot, dodge, slide, use power-ups, and do whatever it takes to stay ahead!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a world on the brink of a great flood, only the fastest ( and smartest ) penguin will secure a spot on the mysterious Ark! This is a fast-paced platformer where you\u2019ll race against time and other competitors on tracks full of challenges and shortcuts. The gameplay is simple to pick up, but mastering your penguin\u2019s movement requires precision and strategy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But beware: speed isn\u2019t everything! If you can\u2019t win the race, sabotage it! Throw snowballs, drop bombs, and even launch missiles to slow down your rivals and claim your rightful place on the Ark.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Speed is Survival</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521750/extras/931429b09eca839e8ff3450ea4594230.poster.avif?t=1772593988\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521750/extras/931429b09eca839e8ff3450ea4594230.webm?t=1772593988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521750/extras/931429b09eca839e8ff3450ea4594230.mp4?t=1772593988\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong></strong><br><strong>Sabotage your rivals</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521750/extras/9b8f91e7e1bed76d92566f73d95dd5e1.poster.avif?t=1772593988\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3521750/extras/9b8f91e7e1bed76d92566f73d95dd5e1.webm?t=1772593988\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: